data/dvipsnames.tsv is a modified extract of the named-color table in
dvipsnam.def, taken from drivers.dtx in the LaTeX graphics bundle
(the %<*dvipsnames> guard). Checked against drivers.dtx 2026-06-26 v3.0m:
https://github.com/latex3/latex2e/blob/develop/required/graphics/drivers.dtx
An unmodified copy of the graphics bundle is also published by CTAN:
