This is a modified version of that table. The LaTeX Project maintains
drivers.dtx. The LaTeX Project does not maintain data/dvipsnames.tsv and
does not provide support for it. The maintenance contact for this extract
is Jeffrey S Carr <jscarr1964@gmail.com>,
https://github.com/jscarr64/LaTeX-Rust.

Modifications from dvipsnam.def, recorded here so the distributed file
satisfies the LPPL requirement that a modified component carry a prominent
notice of what changed (LPPL-1.3c clause 6(b)), together with a pointer to
an unmodified copy (clause 6(d)):

- Each \DefineNamedColor{named}{Name}{cmyk}{c,m,y,k} line is stored as a
  tab-separated row: name, c, m, y, k.
- Rows are re-sorted alphabetically by name. Upstream order is the dvips
  color-wheel order, which starts at GreenYellow and ends at White.
- CMYK components match drivers.dtx 2026-06-26 v3.0m, including TealBlue
  0.86, 0, 0.34, 0.02.

The same notice is in the header of data/dvipsnames.tsv. The file name is
data/dvipsnames.tsv. The table is compiled into the latex-rust named-color
registry. The rest of this crate is separate from the graphics bundle and
is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0, as stated above.
